lavaland-objective-paper-ore = [head=2]Expedition objective: bluespace delivery[/head]
    Deploy the bluespace well on Lavaland. Load at least 1,000 ore units, reach 100%, and choose Send. The empty well returns after one minute.
lavaland-objective-paper-morkite = [head=2]Expedition objective: morkite extraction[/head]
    Find the morkite extractors near the base and connect them by pipes to the gas port and pump beneath the bluespace well. Fill the separate morkite meter within eight minutes, then send the well.
